1
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:03,562
A customer scans the QR code at the table and lands on Acme — Mission St.

2
00:00:03,562 --> 00:00:05,016
The menu shows photos, dietary tags, and a category sidebar on the left.

3
00:00:05,016 --> 00:00:07,807
They tap Italian Tiramisu — it goes straight to the cart.

4
00:00:07,807 --> 00:00:09,009
Mango Lassi has size options — the picker opens to choose.

5
00:00:09,009 --> 00:00:09,962
They pick Medium and add it.

6
00:00:09,962 --> 00:00:11,012
A "Review order" bar appears at the bottom with the running total.

7
00:00:11,012 --> 00:00:11,914
The cart drawer shows both items, modifiers, and the subtotal.

8
00:00:11,914 --> 00:00:14,690
They tap Checkout — the button shows a spinner until the page loads.

9
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:17,063
On checkout: they enter a name and a Mexican phone number.

10
00:00:17,063 --> 00:00:22,487
ASAP pickup is the default — they confirm and place the order.

11
00:00:22,487 --> 00:00:26,057
Order placed! The page shows the order number and a tracking link.

12
00:00:26,057 --> 00:00:28,059
The tracking page polls every 5 seconds — status starts at "Received".

13
00:00:28,059 --> 00:00:30,261
When the kitchen accepts, fires, and bumps each item, this page advances.

14
00:00:30,261 --> 00:00:34,263
After the cashier closes the ticket with payment, the customer sees "Picked up — Order complete!"
